{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2021-07-23 08:08:00', 'title': 'LUMEN EXPANDS ITS FIBER NETWORK IN EUROPE', 'text': 'DENVER, JULY 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AS THE 4TH INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION CONTINUES TO ACCELERATE BUSINESS DEMAND FOR HIGH-SPEED BROADBAND AND PRESENCE IN THE CLOUD, LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LUMN) HAS EXPANDED ITS FIBER NETWORK INFRASTRUCTURE IN EUROPE, STRENGTHENING ITS SERVICE CAPABILITIES IN FRANCE, SWITZERLAND AND SPAIN. THESE STRATEGIC NETWORK EXPANSIONS PUT HIGH-PERFORMANCE FIBER CLOSER TO END USERS TO DELIVER FASTER CONNECTIONS, LOWER LATENCY AND ENHANCED SECURITY, FOR AN EXCEPTIONAL CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE.'}